  "story": [
    "Kranz is German for wreath.  Eleven straight spokes ring the hub, and that ring gives the wheel its name.",
    "Gabel is the wheel Breitspur 02 is shown on: five bold spokes and a Black Series stance.  Kranz is the other answer for the same car, closer to the wheels an owner could have ordered in the nineties.  The face stays flat, the spokes widen slightly as they reach a deep lip, and the assembly hardware is hidden.",
    "It was designed for the R129, and like every wheel from the studio it is machined to the fitment of the car it goes on."
  ],
